# gr-L0-nfr-spec-quality-gate — LLM-Driven Colang Implementation
# Layer: L0 — fires at L0-requirements-nfr-classifier-evaluator's post_execution
# Validates L0-requirements-nfr-classifier's RESULTANT output (not the evaluator's own bookkeeping)
# Python actions preserved in actions.py for reference/hybrid mode

define flow check output nfr spec quality gate
  """LLM validates L0-requirements-nfr-classifier's resultant output against its own schema and evaluation.md rubric."""
  $result = execute self_check_output

  if not $result
    bot block nfr spec quality gate violation
    stop

define bot block nfr spec quality gate violation
  "L0-requirements-nfr-classifier's resultant output (post-evaluation) failed its quality gate: schema violation, an ID gap, a TBD/source mismatch, an invalid citation form, a silently-skipped category, or a fabricated/premature-TBD boundary condition detected. The workflow cannot proceed to prd-composer with non-conformant NFR classifications. Retrying."
